# 🎓 Key Learnings

- Good decisions come from structured thinking, not just intuition.
- Breaking complex choices into smaller evaluation criteria reduces decision fatigue.
- Cognitive biases often influence choices more than facts.
- Testing assumptions before committing leads to more confident decisions.
- AI can serve as a thinking partner rather than simply providing answers.

